00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:50.420
something like that before. Maybe a high school graduation party, maybe even with like birthday

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:54.760
gifts or something. Okay, I got to keep track of that. Maybe at a wedding, you're like, okay,

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:59.640
