00:27:03.780 --> 00:27:11.580
if a gift is truly a gift, then our works, our efforts, our contribution to it is nothing. It

00:27:11.580 --> 00:27:17.880
means nothing. And in fact, if we try to bring our work, our effort, our accomplishment to it,

00:27:18.020 --> 00:27:24.340
it actually cancels out what that thing is to begin with. It makes it nothing. And it, yeah,

00:27:24.340 --> 00:27:27.220
Yeah, it doesn't do anything good, right?

00:27:27.800 --> 00:27:29.160
